{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":9929,\"title\":\"Promised Land\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"When Russell Greene loses his job, he decides to go on the road with his family. So he gathers his family including his wife Claire, his son Josh, his daughter Dinah his mother, Hattie, and his nephew Nathaniel and hits the road. With only an old Suburban, a trailer, and a dream, Russell and his family are now traveling across the country in search of adventure and helping many people along the way. Promised Land was a spinoff of the series Touched By An Angel and had several crossover episodes with that series, as well as one with Diagnosis Murder.\\n\\nPromised Land is an American drama series which aired on CBS from 1996 to 1999. It is a spin-off from another series, Touched by an Angel.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b3EMQiNs97Qpru81tYAwP8Tt8S6.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/MN54fod_YzQ/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":7,\"year\":1996,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Canceled\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":3,\"totalEpisodes\":68,\"createdBy\":[\"Martha Williamson\"],\"networks\":[\"CBS\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"US\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"1999-05-20\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1211992,\"name\":\"Victor Lobl\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":41406,\"name\":\"Stuart Margolin\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/quIAkn7C30u96sbSgsMKGrWkFyj.jpg\"},{\"id\":1214045,\"name\":\"Martha Mitchell\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":102638,\"name\":\"Terrence O'Hara\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":46000,\"name\":\"Sandor Stern\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2NH4SPhwtwWQqnUEf9xCuZOq42.jpg\"},{\"id\":14874,\"name\":\"Gene Reynolds\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6yDAz